  "details": "My full-body tracking stops functioning, and puts my avatar in 'half-body' when I load into a world when the SteamVR menu is open.\nRemedies to fix the problem are:\n*Recalibrating\n*Resetting avatar via action menu (SDK3)\n*Loading into a new world without having the SteamVR menu open\n\nI find it quite annoying when I'm checking and using SteamVR overlays while the world loads in, then I must go about fixing or recalibrating full-body. Even though this seems more like a SteamVR issue rather than a VRChat bug, is there anything that can be done to have VIVE trackers continue to cooperate in the SteamVR menu?",
